# Binary Trajectory files (The biggest culprits)
*.xtc
*.trr
*.dcd
*.netcdf
*.nc

# Topology and Structure (Keep these if they are small, ignore if large)
*.tpr
*.gro
*.pdb

# Log and Energy files
*.edr
*.log
*.cpt
*.out

# Temporary/Backup files
